{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块大号白色文字，绿色情绪竖线旁的两行长句。位置最靠上，字号大、亮度高，首先吸引视线。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他不知不觉流露了喜欢，对方已经看出他有多在乎。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不确定。能隐约看到想抱紧对方的亲近感，但核心的失落、担忧和不安没有在第一眼直接呈现。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他发现对方看出自己的心意后，心里变得空落落，不知道该怎么继续相处；还担心对方嫌自己太黏，原本熟悉的亲近感也因此变得疏远。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"三块字号、亮度相近的大号白字争夺主视线，第一块之后缺少明确的视觉主次。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里：第一块交代心意被看出，第二块写失落和不知所措，第三块写害怕被嫌弃，需要拼接才能理解处境与感受的关系。\",\n    \"每块主文字都较长，单块内部包含多个层次的信息，快速扫视难以同时拿到。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0696fbcf-709a-42d2-a1b3-a8355adb5ba3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T030316185380Z", "elapsed_seconds": 21.344, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:03:37.538005+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b60ee052139fc7bb50f7cb4f8e3611e6155d0ee18431d80ac6ebb6a09ece6c41", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9